# A .pubignore REPLACES any .gitignore in the same directory for publishing.
# This package has no .gitignore of its own, so none is displaced here.
#
# Monorepo-development path overrides. These MUST NOT ship: they point at
# sibling directories that exist only inside this monorepo. When they sat
# inline in example/pubspec.yaml they shipped to pub.dev and made the example
# unresolvable (`dart pub get` exit 66, "path which doesn't exist").
pubspec_overrides.yaml
example/pubspec_overrides.yaml
